{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02365","headline":"杂歌谣辞 古歌 · 沈佺期","name":"杂歌谣辞 古歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落叶流风向玉台，夜寒秋思洞房开。\n水精帘外金波下，云母窗前银汉回。\n玉阶阴阴苔藓色，君王履綦难再得。\n璇闺窈窕秋夜长，绣户徘徊秋月光。\n燕姬彩帐芙蓉色，秦子金炉兰麝香。\n北斗七星横夜半，清歌一曲断君肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}